<span id="Introduction"></span>
== Въведение ==

[[Combo_View|Combo View]] се появява в панел, наречен '''Model'''. Той комбинира [[Tree_View/bg|Tree View]] (Дървовиден изглед в горната част) и [[Property_View|Property View]] (Преглед на свойствата в долна част).

[[Task_Panel|Task Panel]], който преди е бил част от Combo View, сега е отделен панел, наречен '''Tasks''' в {{VersionPlus|1.0}}. Той може да бъде [[#Dock_Task_Panel_on_top_of_combo_View|docked]] на върха на Combo View, за да се постигне компактно оформление като в по-ранни версии.

[[File:Combo_View_Example.png]]
{{Caption|The Combo View (Model tab) with docked Task Panel (Tasks tab)}}

== Dock Task Panel on top of Combo View ==

# Make sure the Combo View is docked along an edge of the FreeCAD window.
# Move the cursor to the very top of the Task Panel.
# The arrow becomes a hand.
# Hold down the left mouse button and drag the Task Panel on top of the Combo View.
# Move vertically until both the upper and lower sections of the Combo View are highlighted.<br>[[File:Tasks_Dockable.png|200px]]
# Release the mouse button.

== Preferences ==

See also: [[Preferences_Editor|Preferences Editor]].

The Combo View is available if {{MenuCommand|Edit → Preferences → General → General → Tree View and Property View mode}} is set to {{Value|Combined}}. If it is set to {{Value|Independent}} the Tree View and the Property View appear as separate panels.


